@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Employee
participant "System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks to assign a route to a train
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows available stations to create a route to
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a station
    activate System

        System --> Employee :shows available cargo to be picked up
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : chooses which cargo it wants to pick up
    activate System

        System --> Employee : shows all data and requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms or cancels route
    activate System

        System --> Employee : sends the train on it's route or cancels it
    deactivate System
@enduml